    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bakacimona bakacema abo abaleonaula umukuni wa bucemi bwandi no kuusalanganya nsale nsale.” Efyasosa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eico ifi efyo Yawe, Lesa wakwa Israeli alesosa kuli bakacema abasunga abantu bakwe. “Namuleka umukuni wandi ukusalangana, tamuusakamene kabili mulekele ulelulumbafye. Ine nkamukanda pa mulandu wa bubifi mwacita,” Efyasosa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne mwine wine nine nomba nkakolonganya umukuni wandi uwashalapo, nkaufumya mu fyalo uko nausalanganishishe, nkaubweseshe na muno mwicinka lyauko. Uli nokusanda no kufulilako mu mpendwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabika bakacema pakati kashiko abakalashisunga. Ninshi nomba tashakatale ashitiina nakabili nangu kututuma, kabili tapakalube nelyo imo.” Ifi efyasosa Yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
